      "content": "thanks. 1000mg of ibu is a lot but i really need the relief. is it okay to take that much with some aleve too? i have both at home and i'm just hoping to knock the pain out so i can pass out. also, i'm feeling a bit dizzy when i stand up, but it's probably just from the pain and getting worked up, right? i'll just stay in bed for now.",
